{
  "abstract": "The Department of the Treasury (\"Treasury,\" \"We,\" or \"Us\") is issuing in final form an amendment to 31 CFR Part 356 (Uniform Offering Circular for the Sale and Issue of Marketable Book- Entry Treasury Bills, Notes, and Bonds) by converting it to plain language. We are issuing this amendment to make our marketable securities auction rules easier to understand. This amendment will also make certain minor revisions to better make the auction rules conform to current practices.",
  "action": "Final rule.",
